name: courses
version: 1.3.0
title: {id: Kursus dan pelatihan, en: Courses and training}
summary:
  id: Program kursus, angkatan, peserta, pendaftaran, jadwal pertemuan dan tagihannya.
  en: Course programmes, cohorts, students, enrolments, sessions and their bills.
category: operations
icon: graduation-cap-line
# Course schools, tutoring centres, online courses and company training: programs, batches (angkatan) with a quota, a
# teacher and a weekly schedule, students (a person or an employee of a client company), enrollments, sessions with
# attendance, and charges (paid in full, in instalments or monthly) that become draft sales invoices. Research and plan:
# rangka research_notes/kursus, plans/kursus.md.
requires: {rangka: '>=0.5', users: ^1.0, contacts: ^1.0, catalogue: ^1.0, invoicing: ^1.8}
